*$
.SUBCKT XOR2_BASIC_GEN A B Y PARAMS: VDD=1 VSS=0 VTHRESH=0.5 
E_ABMGATE  YINT 0 VALUE {{IF(V(A) > {VTHRESH}  ^  
+ V(B) > {VTHRESH},{VDD},{VSS})}}
RINT YINT Y 1
CINT Y 0 1n
.ENDS XOR2_BASIC_GEN
*$
.SUBCKT XNOR2_BASIC_GEN A B Y PARAMS: VDD=1 VSS=0 VTHRESH=0.5 
